    "Apple confirms Bluetooth connections aren't lossless. Playing a FLAC or ALAC file to AirPods delivers, at best, ~256 kbps AAC at your ear. AirPods Pro 3's spec sheet lists “No Lossless Audio”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple bestätigt: Bluetooth-Verbindungen sind nicht verlustfrei. Eine FLAC- oder ALAC-Datei kommt über AirPods bestenfalls als AAC mit ~256 kbit/s an. Im Datenblatt der AirPods Pro 3 steht „No Lossless Audio“."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple lo confirma: las conexiones Bluetooth no son lossless. Un archivo FLAC o ALAC llega a tus AirPods como AAC de ~256 kbps, en el mejor de los casos. La ficha técnica de los AirPods Pro 3 indica “No Lossless Audio”."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple le confirme : les connexions Bluetooth ne sont pas lossless. Un fichier FLAC ou ALAC arrive au mieux en AAC ~256 kbit/s dans vos AirPods. La fiche technique des AirPods Pro 3 indique « No Lossless Audio »."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple lo conferma: le connessioni Bluetooth non sono lossless. Un file FLAC o ALAC arriva agli AirPods al massimo come AAC a ~256 kbps. La scheda tecnica degli AirPods Pro 3 riporta “No Lossless Audio”."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AppleもBluetooth接続はロスレスではないと明言しています。FLACやALACのファイルでも、AirPodsに届くのはよくても約256 kbpsのAACです。AirPods Pro 3の仕様には「No Lossless Audio」と記載されています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple도 블루투스 연결은 무손실이 아니라고 밝힙니다. FLAC이나 ALAC 파일도 AirPods까지는 잘해야 약 256kbps AAC로 전달됩니다. AirPods Pro 3 사양에는 “No Lossless Audio”라고 적혀 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple potwierdza, że połączenia Bluetooth nie są bezstratne. Odtwarzanie pliku FLAC lub ALAC na AirPods daje w najlepszym razie ~256 kbps AAC w twoim uchu. Karta danych AirPods Pro 3 wprost podaje „Brak dźwięku bezstratnego”."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Apple confirma: conexões Bluetooth não são lossless. Um arquivo FLAC ou ALAC chega aos AirPods, na melhor das hipóteses, como AAC de ~256 kbps. A ficha técnica dos AirPods Pro 3 traz “No Lossless Audio”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 已确认：蓝牙连接不是无损。FLAC 或 ALAC 文件传到 AirPods，最好也只是约 256 kbps 的 AAC。AirPods Pro 3 的规格表写着“No Lossless Audio”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 已確認：藍牙連線並非無損。將 FLAC 或 ALAC 檔案播放到 AirPods，傳到你耳裡的最多也只有約 256 kbps 的 AAC。AirPods Pro 3 的規格表上寫著「No Lossless Audio」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
